## 🚨 CRITICAL ISSUES IDENTIFIED

### 1. vLLM Startup Failures
- **Error**: ZMQ (ZeroMQ) socket polling timeout during engine initialization
- **Version Tested**: v0.16.0 (current working environment), v0.17.1 (system-wide), v0.15.0 (attempted downgrade)
- **Model**: Qwen2.5-Coder-1.5B-Instruct (GGUF format) - NOT 7B as requested
- **Root Cause**: vLLM engine core client fails to initialize multiprocessing sockets

### 2. Model Mismatch Issue
```
