### 3. OpenViking Integration Architecture
```
CURRENT SETUP:
┌─────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌─────────────┐
│ OpenViking  │    │   vLLM       │    │   Model     │
│  (OpenAI    │───▶│ (OpenAI API  │───▶│  (GGUF)     │
│  Config)    │    │  Compatibility)│    │             │
└─────────────┘    └──────────────┘    └─────────────┘

WHY BRIDGE LAYER NEEDED:
- OpenViking only supports: openai, volcengine, vikingdb, jina, ollama, voyage
- vLLM provides OpenAI-compatible API endpoint
- Translation required: OpenViking OpenAI config → vLLM server
```

